# Automation Selenium

## Overview
This repository contains my hands-on practice and daily coding exercises in **Selenium WebDriver using Java**. It documents my learning journey in automation testing through structured daily exercises and practical implementations.

## Repository Structure

```text
automation_selenium/
│
├── Day1/
│   └── Selenium Basics
│
├── Day2/
│   └── WebDriver Methods
│
├── Day3/
│   └── Web Element Types and Interactions
│
└── README.md
```

## Technologies and Tools
- Java
- Selenium WebDriver
- Maven
- IntelliJ IDEA
- Git and GitHub

## Topics Covered
- Selenium WebDriver Fundamentals
- Browser Launch and Navigation
- WebDriver Methods
- Web Element Types
- Web Element Identification
- Web Element Interactions
- Locators and Element Handling

