## Learning Objectives
- Gain practical experience with Selenium WebDriver.
- Understand browser automation using Java.
- Learn to identify and interact with web elements.
- Develop automation testing skills through hands-on coding.
- Build a strong foundation in software test automation.

## Purpose
This repository serves as a structured record of my daily Selenium automation practice, technical learning, and continuous progress in software testing.

